   table.evaluation-overview thead p {
       line-height: 1.2;
       margin: 0;
   }
   table.evaluation-overview thead em {
       color: var(--pst-color-text-base);
       display: block;
       font-size: 0.8em;
       font-style: italic;
       font-weight: normal;
       line-height: 1.25;
       margin-top: 0.2rem;
       opacity: 0.75;
   }
   table.tool-qualification-report tbody a {
       font-size: 0.8em;
       font-style: italic;
       opacity: 0.75;
   }
   </style>

.. list-table:: Evaluation overview
   :header-rows: 1
   :class: evaluation-overview tool-qualification-report
   :widths: 20 25 12 20 13 10

   * - **Use case**
       *Capability being evaluated.*
     - **Potential malfunction**
       *Failure mode if the capability is wrong.*
     - **Safety affected**
       *Can this affect safety?*
     - **Safety measures**
       *Measures used during normal operation.*
     - **Detection sufficient**
       *Detected before the output is relied on?*
     - **SCORE TCL**
       *Per-malfunction classification.*
{% for usecase in usecases %}
{% for malfunction in linked_needs(usecase["id"], "parent_needs_back") %}
   * - | {{ text(usecase.get("title")) }}
       | {{ need_reference(usecase) }}
     - | {{ text(malfunction.get("title")) }}
       | {{ need_reference(malfunction) }}
     - {{ text(malfunction.get("safety_affected")) }}
     - {{ text(malfunction.get("safety_measures")) }}
     - {{ text(malfunction.get("detection_sufficient")) }}
     - {% if malfunction.get("safety_affected") != "YES" or malfunction.get("detection_sufficient") == "YES" %}HIGH{% elif malfunction.get("detection_sufficient") == "NO" %}LOW{% else %}open{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
{% if not usecases %}
   * - No tool use cases.
     - —
